{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-015", "score": 0.126, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-015 | Study family SF-APPS-015: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- observed_research_question: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams and players differ in how often H2 trigger possessions land on the engine's BEST vs AVOID counter.\n- observed_result: Team AVOID% ranges 50.6% (ORL) to 6.8% (SAC); team BEST% 0.0%-15.8%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No outcome test; player samples 10-178 possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: min 10 poss per player\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-048\n- observed_method: trigger_table_clean.csv, 55 series 2022-2026, 179 players, 25 teams, min 10 poss.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-001"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-086", "score": 0.11, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-086 | Study family SF-CHT-086: LLM / ex-ante usefulness of suppression context (leakage audit)\n- observed_research_question: LLM / ex-ante usefulness of suppression context (leakage audit)\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: An LLM layer can reason about suppression context beyond the engine, or predicting suppression from H1 is a viable label.\n- observed_result: Label is mostly an RTM artifact. Apparent LLM skill was leakage; what survives is small/noisy; engine misses are selection/override not missing graph facts. Margin of LLM vs engine described as literally zero after leaka [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:RTM_SELECTION\n- observed_failure_evidence: Suppression label selected on the outcome; remaining LLM edge not statistically retrievable.\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-005"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-005", "score": 0.106, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-005 | Study family SF-APPA-005: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)\n- observed_research_question: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Playoff defenses change scheme within games and between games, especially after the opponent ran a play type heavily.\n- observed_result: Within-game change 319/523 (61.0%); cross-game change 298/440 (67.7%); 103/104 units (99.0%) and 52/52 series show a change; transition matrices near-uniform.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- observed_failure_evidence: Doc caveat: inferred label cannot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 523 cells; 440 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-039", "score": 0.097, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-039 | Study family SF-CHT-039: Series-level AVOID share vs winning (talent confound)\n- observed_research_question: Series-level AVOID share vs winning (talent confound)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Higher AVOID share predicts losing, independent of team quality.\n- observed_result: Game-level rho=-0.19 p=0.008 (inflated n, team-quality confound). Series-level rho=-0.26 p=0.07 (n=50, underpowered; ~80 series needed for p<0.05). Low AVOID-share bin 52.6% vs 25-50% bin 37.0%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:confounding\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:CONFOUNDING\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Series n=50 p=0.07; still confounded by team quality (OKC disciplined and good).\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=50 series; stated need ~80 for p<0.05\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive"}], "n_results": 4}

Stage 2. Using the retrieval result above (follow-up tools are allowed within the tool budget), complete steps 4 to 9
and reply with the final action. Output schema (all fields required):
